{
  "id": "admin",
  "version": "0.1.2",
  "title": "Admin console",
  "description": "First-admin bootstrap, user directory, and role management. Pair with roles.",
  "side": "both",
  "capabilities": [
    "admin",
    "admin-console",
    "first-admin",
    "bootstrap-admin",
    "user-management",
    "moderation-inbox"
  ],
  "requires": [
    "i18n",
    "theme",
    "navigation",
    "auth",
    "roles",
    "firestore",
    "functions",
    "callable-client"
  ],
  "dependencies": {},
  "wire": {
    "markers": [
      {
        "file": "functions/src/index.ts",
        "marker": "functions",
        "when": "functions",
        "block": "export { bootstrapFirstAdmin } from './callable/bootstrapFirstAdmin';"
      },
      {
        "file": "lib/callable-contracts.ts",
        "marker": "contracts",
        "when": "callable-client",
        "block": "bootstrapFirstAdmin: {\n    request: Record<string, never>;\n    response: { ok: true; already: boolean };\n  };"
      },
      {
        "file": "app/(app)/(tabs)/settings.tsx",
        "marker": "settings",
        "imports": [
          "import { AdminSettingsSection } from '@/components/settings/AdminSettingsSection';"
        ],
        "block": "<AdminSettingsSection />"
      },
      {
        "file": "app/(app)/(drawer)/settings.tsx",
        "marker": "settings",
        "imports": [
          "import { AdminSettingsSection } from '@/components/settings/AdminSettingsSection';"
        ],
        "block": "<AdminSettingsSection />"
      },
      {
        "file": "app/(app)/settings.tsx",
        "marker": "settings",
        "imports": [
          "import { AdminSettingsSection } from '@/components/settings/AdminSettingsSection';"
        ],
        "block": "<AdminSettingsSection />"
      }
    ]
  },
  "firebase": {
    "functions": ["bootstrapFirstAdmin"]
  },
  "notes": [
    "The first signed-in user to tap Become admin receives role=admin custom claims.",
    "Later callers are no-ops once _radiance/admin exists.",
    "setUserClaims (roles module) mirrors role onto users/{uid} for the admin directory.",
    "`app/(app)/admin/_layout.tsx` sets the stack title from `admin.title` (avoids Expo Router's `admin/index` fallback)."
  ]
}
